  Added one terminator byte to logChunkTextBuffer so ReadLogTransferChunk can
  read 2048 data bytes rather than 2047, keeping successive reads on 512-byte
  SD-sector boundaries. Packet formats and the reader's terminator contract
  are unchanged. Built STM32 and uploaded the signed ZIP over COM18.
